    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d2fc4d0e746944c8e629a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢啦！　你这么说我就心中有依仗了！\n总有一天我会变得更加帅气的！　还，还有啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efa6c9dd55e5a0d35f670947f277d7618a7793f050a424d95383c507a22cd7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
