      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，最终弯道。――就在这里一决胜负！\n最终追赶！　冲・了・啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf12944406a7aad2d06800a9d180aa23206633bbcc74a7e3dec9b149c881aeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
