    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d172f76c42f7e3f59db09166",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顺便也帮我克服一下弱点吧。\n那个……比如一看到爱情戏，就脊背发凉什么的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1caf928b6c8b1b040d8d525926670a738d0af0cfa27411e9eb71654256e37640",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
