    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe90f1ae47693f191c57a76c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "笨蛋，这可不是害羞了什么的ー！　你别误会了。\n……也别往外讲。敢跟别人说我就一脚把你踹飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6df02184c7d1d273fcae513a877ec6f9cfba2d91af1eae764b9e0aaaea0f76b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1008/storytimeline_041008005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d20bafb4a37a5fff88d68c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加耸着肩膀愤愤地走了。\n她的脖子不知为何是通红的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7588b72935c5583547a5316bab2eda1971b85ee13a4b96ecc399fd29483515",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1008/storytimeline_041008005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33648442efb00fd47a28c347",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她追得很紧……\n结果，伏特加还是以2马身差落败了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014199fab923e367b5699f2461d5b5a388657edf308782ef949e37bdddf2a50c",
